    {
      "name": "Chat",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Send Message",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "x-user-email",
                "value": "{{userEmail}}",
                "description": "Email user yang sudah login. Divalidasi terhadap database (appUser, isActive check)."
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"message\": \"Apa definisi IKU 3?\",\n  \"scope\": {\n    \"kind\": \"iku\",\n    \"ikuCode\": \"IKU 003\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE_URL}}/api/chat",
              "host": ["{{BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["api", "chat"]
            },
            "description": "Kirim pesan ke chatbot berbasis RAG (FastAPI).\n\nAuth: Header 'x-user-email' wajib diisi dengan email user yang sudah login.\nEmail divalidasi ke database — user harus ada dan isActive = true.\n\nAlur:\n1. Next.js validasi auth via DB\n2. Next.js kirim pertanyaan ke FastAPI RAG service (POST /v1/answer)\n3. Jika RAG minta data spreadsheet (action.type = 'fetch_data'), Next.js ambil data dari spreadsheet tool\n4. Next.js kirim ulang ke RAG dengan data spreadsheet untuk jawaban final\n\nScope (opsional):\n- kind: 'iku' untuk pertanyaan spesifik satu IKU, 'overview' untuk ringkasan semua IKU\n- ikuCode: kode IKU spesifik (misal: 'IKU 003')\n\nEnvironment variables yang dibutuhkan:\n- RAG_SERVICE_URL: URL base FastAPI RAG service\n- RAG_SERVICE_TOKEN: Token autentikasi internal ke RAG service"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Chat Berhasil (RAG Response)",
